### ========== USUARIOS ==========

### Get All Usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Usuarios?Page=1&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Usuario by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Usuario by Email
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Usuarios?Email=usuario@example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novousuario@example.com",
  "nome": "Novo Usuario",
  "senha_hash": "senha_hash_aqui"
}

### Update Usuario
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@example.com",
  "nome": "Usuario Atualizado",
  "ativo": true
}

### Delete Usuario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change Password
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Usuarios/trocar-senha/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senha_atual": "senha_antiga",
  "nova_senha": "senha_nova"
}

