Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Regime Tributario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/RegimesTributarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_tenant": 1,
  "id_empresa": 1,
  "dt_ini": "2024-01-01",
  "ano": 2024,
  "raiz_cnpj": "12345678",
  "forma_trib_completa": "Lucro Real",
  "forma_apur_completa": "Trimestral"
